# Rust-specific ignores
target/
Cargo.lock

# Build artifacts
**/*.d
**/*.rlib
**/*.rmeta
**/*.so
**/deps/
**/incremental/
**/build/

# Cargo build cache
**/.cargo-artifact-lock
**/.cargo-build-lock
**/.cargo-lock
**/.fingerprint/

# Temporary files
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.log

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

```